WEBVTT

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:09.044
<v><b>Hartley:</b></v> Héloise will go.

00:00:09.826 --> 00:00:12.834
I haven’t had one day without problems since I met her.

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:16.825
You’re right, Vivienne.

00:00:18.513 --> 00:00:21.248
Héloise must go before I can take you home.

00:00:22.322 --> 00:00:23.591
But she will go.

00:00:25.327 --> 00:00:26.201
I’ve decided…

00:00:28.738 --> 00:00:32.563
<v><b>Vivienne:</b></v> Then…my answer is yes.

00:00:33.203 --> 00:00:34.758
I will be yours.

00:00:35.108 --> 00:00:35.851
<v><b>Hartley:</b></v> Promise me.

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:38.009
<v><b>Vivienne:</b></v> I promise.

00:00:41.110 --> 00:00:42.620
<v><b>Hartley:</b></v> I will come for you tomorrow.

00:00:44.037 --> 00:00:44.724
<v><b>Vivienne:</b></v> Tomorrow.

00:00:56.614 --> 00:00:58.649
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> An hour and forty minutes later,

00:00:58.765 --> 00:01:02.549
Hartley stepped off the train when it stopped in the suburbs.

00:01:04.835 --> 00:01:09.499
He walked to his house, went inside and walked up the stairs.